	["Hunts what is worth a lot: the elites, the rares, the bosses, the dungeons, the raids and the enemies. Every head has its price."] = "Caça o que vale muito: as elites, as criaturas raras, os chefes, as masmorras, as raides e os inimigos. Toda cabeça tem seu preço.",
