	["Each day, you can order from the reseller a card you are missing, epic at most, at its full price. The first time: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每天，你可以按全价向转卖商订购一张你缺少的卡牌（最高史诗）。首次触发：获得一个成就和一个尊荣头衔。",
	["Each day, your first 5 boosters opened: a %s chance that one of their cards goes up a rarity (epic at most)."] = "每天打开的前 5 个补充包：有%s的几率使其中一张卡牌的稀有度提升一级（最高史诗）。",
