	["Each new visa of your travel passport gives you %s rubies and %s experience."] = "旅行护照上每多一个新签证，你获得 %s 颗红宝石和 %s 经验值。",
	["Each rare you defeat fills your booster bar of the world with %s points."] = "你每击败一个稀有生物，为你的世界进度条提供 %s 点。",
