	["The innkeeper's bet takes 3 copies instead of 2, but the card of the rarity above comes twice as often."] = "旅店老板的赌局需要押上 3 张而不是 2 张，但高一级稀有度的卡牌出现几率翻倍。",
	["The innkeeper's bet takes one copy only, but one more card wins nothing."] = "旅店老板的赌局只需押上 1 张，但会多一张什么也没有的卡牌。",
	["The innkeepers you are a regular of tell you two rumors a day instead of one."] = "你是常客的旅店老板每天告诉你两条传闻，而不是一条。",
