	["The surveyor of the Explorers' League: the places, the gathering, the inns and their rumors fill the albums of the zones. Strong from the first levels."] = "探险者协会的勘测员：地点、采集、旅店及其传闻，都能充实地区收藏册。从最初几级起就很强力。",
