	["The thunderforged and titanforged cards of your boosters give %s more experience."] = "你补充包中的雷霆铸造和泰坦造物卡牌提供的经验值提高%s。",
	["The tooltip of a card tells you what the reseller gives you for a copy, and what he sells it for."] = "卡牌的鼠标提示会显示转卖商回收一张的价格，以及他的售价。",
	["The trades with your guild do not count among the 5 players a day of Handshake, and give twice as much."] = "与公会成员的交换不计入握手成交每天 5 名玩家的限制，且收益翻倍。",
