	["Until level %d, a reroll opens nothing (no booster, display or case), does no quest of the collector, uses no booster to choose, signs no contract and counts for no achievement."] = "%d 级之前，小号不能打开任何东西（补充包、补充包盒、箱子），不能做收藏家任务，不能使用自选补充包，不能签署契约，也不计入成就。",
	["Until level %d, a reroll opens nothing (no booster, display or case), does no quest of the collector, uses no booster to choose, signs no contract and counts for no achievement: your main character, %s, does all of that."] = "%d 级之前，小号不能打开任何东西（补充包、补充包盒、箱子），不能做收藏家任务，不能使用自选补充包，不能签署契约，也不计入成就：这些都由你的主角色（%s）来做。",
