	["Each card appraised gives you %s experience, three times as much for a 9 or a 10."] = "每鑑定一張卡牌給你 %s 經驗值，評分 9 或 10 時為三倍。",
	["Each card bought from the reseller gives you back %s of its price in rubies."] = "每張從轉賣商處購買的卡牌，會以紅寶石返還其價格的%s。",
	["Each collector level: a booster to choose, for the album you want."] = "每個收藏家等級：一個自選補充包，可放入你想要的收藏冊。",
	["Each collector who looks at your showcase gives you 5 rubies (20 visitors a day at most)."] = "每位查看你展示櫃的收藏家給你 5 顆紅寶石（每天最多 20 位訪客）。",
	["Each contract signed gives you %s experience."] = "每簽署一份契約給你 %s 經驗值。",
	["Each day, a target is named to you: an elite or a rare of a zone of your level whose card you are missing. Defeat it and its card is given to you. The first time: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每天為你指定一個目標：在符合你等級的地區中，一個你缺少其卡牌的精英或稀有生物。擊敗它，其卡牌就歸你。首次觸發：獲得一個成就和一個尊榮頭銜。",
	["Each day, among the cards the reseller sells, one is surely missing from your albums."] = "每天，轉賣商出售的卡牌中，必定有一張是你收藏冊所缺的。",
	["Each day, spin the wheel: nothing (40 %%), 150 rubies (30 %%), a booster of a zone (22 %%), two boosters of a zone (6 %%) or a booster of a dungeon (2 %%). The first time it stops on the booster of a dungeon: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每天轉動一次輪盤：無（40%%）、150 顆紅寶石（30%%）、一個地區補充包（22%%）、兩個地區補充包（6%%）或一個地城補充包（2%%）。首次停在地城補充包上時：獲得一個成就和一個尊榮頭銜。",
	["Each day, you can order from the reseller a card you are missing, epic at most, at its full price. The first time: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每天，你可以向轉賣商以全價訂購一張你缺少的卡牌（最高史詩）。首次觸發：獲得一個成就和一個尊榮頭銜。",
	["Each day, your first 5 boosters opened: a %s chance that one of their cards goes up a rarity (epic at most)."] = "每天你打開的前 5 個補充包：有%s的機率使其中一張卡牌的稀有度提升一級（最高史詩）。",
	["Each day, your first quest turned in in each zone fills its bar with %s more points."] = "每天你在每個地區交付的第一個任務，為其進度條額外填充 %s 點。",
	["Each day, your first victory over a creature whose card you are missing (rare at most), in a zone where you have less than three quarters of the cards, gives you its card. The first time: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每天，在你擁有不到四分之三卡牌的地區，你首次擊敗一個你缺少其卡牌的生物（最高精良）時，會獲得它的卡牌。首次觸發：獲得一個成就和一個尊榮頭銜。",
	["Each elite or rare whose card you find gives you %s rubies."] = "每找到一張精英或稀有生物的卡牌，給你 %s 顆紅寶石。",
	["Each herb, ore, skin or fish you gather gives %s points to your booster bar of the world (a creature gives 2)."] = "每次採集草藥、礦石、皮革或魚，為你的世界進度條提供 %s 點（一個生物提供 2 點）。",
	["Each honorable kill fills your booster bar of the world with %s points."] = "每次榮譽擊殺為你的世界進度條填充 %s 點。",
	["Each new combatant certified in your PvP album gives you %s rubies."] = "PvP 收藏冊中每認證一名新戰士，給你 %s 顆紅寶石。",
	["Each new visa of your travel passport gives you %s rubies and %s experience."] = "旅行護照上每個新簽證給你 %s 顆紅寶石和 %s 經驗值。",
	["Each rare you defeat fills your booster bar of the world with %s points."] = "你每擊敗一個稀有生物，為你的世界進度條填充 %s 點。",
	["Each thing gathered has a %s chance to give you 25 rubies."] = "每次採集有%s的機率給你 25 顆紅寶石。",
	["Each trade confirmed gives you 10 rubies (5 trades a day)."] = "每次確認的交換給你 10 顆紅寶石（每天最多 5 次交換）。",
	["Each week you open 50 boosters or more: %s rubies."] = "每週打開 50 個或更多補充包：%s 顆紅寶石。",
	["Each week, the first last boss of a dungeon or boss of a raid you defeat gives you one more booster of its album."] = "每週你擊敗的第一個地城最終首領或團隊副本首領，額外給你一個其收藏冊的補充包。",
	["Each week, when you hold more than 20 000 rubies, you earn %s of them (300 at most for each rank)."] = "每週，當你持有超過 20000 顆紅寶石時，可獲得持有量的%s（每個等級最多 300 顆）。",
	["Each week, your best appraised copy gives you %s rubies (three times as many for a 10)."] = "每週，你鑑定評分最高的卡牌給你 %s 顆紅寶石（評分 10 時為三倍）。",
	["Each week, your first booster opened has one chance in ten to become a booster of legend: 5 cards epic or better, one of them legendary. The first time: an achievement and a title of prestige."] = "每週你打開的第一個補充包有十分之一的機率成為傳說補充包：5 張史詩或更好的卡牌，其中一張為傳說。首次觸發：獲得一個成就和一個尊榮頭銜。",
