	["In a group, the elites and the bosses you defeat fill your booster bar %s more."] = "在隊伍中時，你擊敗的精英和首領使補充包進度條的填充速度提高%s。",
	["In the chest"] = "寶箱內容",
	["In the dungeons and the raids, a bar of their own: %d boosters a day at most, their album yours to choose."] = "地城和團隊副本有專屬的進度條：每天最多 %d 個補充包，收藏冊由你選擇。",
