	["In your boosters, your epic cards and better: +%s chance to come thunderforged."] = "你的補充包中，史詩或更好的卡牌：成為雷霆鑄造的機率 +%s。",
	["It earns everything from level 1, and its chest opens now. Your main changes once a month at most."] = "它從 1 級起獲得全部獎勵，寶箱也會立即打開。主角色每月最多更換一次。",
